        "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:51:17.228Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am facing an issue while accessing the NPPE problem files on the OPPE VM.<br>\nThe <code>README.md</code> file inside the <code>nppe_1</code> directory is not displaying correctly.<br>\nMost of the problem statement appears corrupted or unreadable when opened in the terminal.</p>\n<p>I have tried using different commands like synchro show, <code>cat</code>, <code>less</code>, and <code>vim</code>, but the content still does not show properly. It seems the file may have formatting or encoding issues.</p>\n<p>I solve the problem using my friends question , but in exam that not face , what will I do</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 2,
        "updated_at": "2025-12-05T18:51:17.228Z",
